<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>63.0</apiVersion>
    <assignments>
        <name>AssignOrderItem</name>
        <label>Armar OrderItem</label>
        <locationX>264</locationX>
        <locationY>864</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_OrderItem.OrderId</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value><elementReference>CreateOrder</elementReference></value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_OrderItem.PricebookEntryId</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value><elementReference>LoopQLIs.PricebookEntryId</elementReference></value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_OrderItem.Quantity</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value><elementReference>LoopQLIs.Quantity</elementReference></value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_OrderItem.UnitPrice</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value><elementReference>LoopQLIs.UnitPrice</elementReference></value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector><targetReference>AddOrderItem</targetReference></connector>
    </assignments>
    <assignments>
        <name>AddOrderItem</name>
        <label>Agregar a la coleccion</label>
        <locationX>264</locationX>
        <locationY>972</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>coll_OrderItems</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value><elementReference>var_OrderItem</elementReference></value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector><targetReference>LoopQLIs</targetReference></connector>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <name>CheckRecordType</name>
        <label>Excluir Mayorista (shell sin proceso)</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>108</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Mayorista - fin</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>NotMayorista</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.DeveloperName</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>GQOpportunitiesMayorista</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>CheckSyncedQuote</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Cualquier linea (motor universal)</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>CheckSyncedQuote</name>
        <label>Tiene Synced Quote?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>216</locationY>
        <defaultConnector><targetReference>TaskSinQuote</targetReference></defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Sin quote sincronizada</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>YesQuote</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.SyncedQuoteId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>GetQuote</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Si</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>CheckAccepted</name>
        <label>Quote aceptada?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>432</locationY>
        <defaultConnector><targetReference>TaskQuoteNoAceptada</targetReference></defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No aceptada</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>YesAccepted</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetQuote.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>Accepted</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>CreateOrder</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Accepted</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>GQ.AUT.COCKPIT 4.1 (adenda 14/07): motor de pedido UNIVERSAL. Cuando la Opportunity pasa a ganada (IsWon false-&gt;true; la org tiene DOS etapas ganadas activas — Ganado y Cerrada ganada — por eso el gatillo es IsWon y no el nombre de etapa): cualquier linea que cierre ganada con quote valida genera pedido — la unica exclusion explicita es el RT GQOpportunitiesMayorista (shell sin proceso). La restriccion Autos/Motos/Flotas vive en la SUPERFICIE (boton del cockpit, 5.1), no en el motor. Gates: SyncedQuote presente y en Accepted; sin quote sincronizada = Task al owner, nunca pedido sin quote. Crea Order Draft (SAP_SyncStatus=Pendiente, Quote__c enlazada, pricebook de la Quote) y copia QuoteLineItems a OrderItems. Fallo de DML = Task con el fault. El envio a SAP es de la integracion (L34) — este flow NO hace callout.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>GenerarPedido {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opp_AS_GenerarPedido</label>
    <loops>
        <name>LoopQLIs</name>
        <label>Por cada linea de la quote</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>756</locationY>
        <collectionReference>GetQLIs</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector><targetReference>AssignOrderItem</targetReference></nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector><targetReference>CreateOrderItems</targetReference></noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value><stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue></value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>CreateOrder</name>
        <label>Crear Order (Draft)</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>540</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>GetQLIs</targetReference></connector>
        <faultConnector><targetReference>TaskFault</targetReference></faultConnector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>AccountId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.AccountId</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>EffectiveDate</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Flow.CurrentDate</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status</field>
            <value><stringValue>Draft</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Pricebook2Id</field>
            <value><elementReference>GetQuote.Pricebook2Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>CurrencyIsoCode</field>
            <value><elementReference>GetQuote.CurrencyIsoCode</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Quote__c</field>
            <value><elementReference>GetQuote.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>SAP_SyncStatus__c</field>
            <value><stringValue>Pendiente</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Order</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>CreateOrderItems</name>
        <label>Crear OrderItems</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>1080</locationY>
        <faultConnector><targetReference>TaskFault</targetReference></faultConnector>
        <inputReference>coll_OrderItems</inputReference>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>TaskSinQuote</name>
        <label>Task: ganada sin quote</label>
        <locationX>440</locationX>
        <locationY>324</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.OwnerId</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <value><stringValue>Pedido NO generado: oportunidad ganada sin cotización sincronizada</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Description</field>
            <value><stringValue>La oportunidad pasó a ganada pero no tiene Synced Quote. Sincroniza la cotización aceptada y vuelve a guardar la etapa, o crea el pedido manualmente.</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>TaskQuoteNoAceptada</name>
        <label>Task: quote no aceptada</label>
        <locationX>440</locationX>
        <locationY>540</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.OwnerId</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <value><stringValue>Pedido NO generado: la cotización sincronizada no está Accepted</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Description</field>
            <value><stringValue>La oportunidad pasó a ganada pero la Synced Quote no está en estado Accepted. Acepta la cotización (Recibir/Cierre del cockpit) y vuelve a guardar la etapa.</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>TaskFault</name>
        <label>Task: fallo al generar pedido</label>
        <locationX>560</locationX>
        <locationY>756</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.OwnerId</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <value><stringValue>ERROR al generar el pedido automático — revisar</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Description</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Flow.FaultMessage</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetQuote</name>
        <label>Get synced Quote</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>324</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>CheckAccepted</targetReference></connector>
        <faultConnector><targetReference>TaskFault</targetReference></faultConnector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.SyncedQuoteId</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Quote</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Status</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Pricebook2Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>CurrencyIsoCode</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetQLIs</name>
        <label>Get Quote Line Items</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>648</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>LoopQLIs</targetReference></connector>
        <faultConnector><targetReference>TaskFault</targetReference></faultConnector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>QuoteId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>GetQuote.Id</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>false</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>QuoteLineItem</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>PricebookEntryId</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Quantity</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>UnitPrice</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>CheckRecordType</targetReference></connector>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>IsWon</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></value>
        </filters>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <variables>
        <name>var_OrderItem</name>
        <dataType>SObject</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
        <objectType>OrderItem</objectType>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>coll_OrderItems</name>
        <dataType>SObject</dataType>
        <isCollection>true</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
        <objectType>OrderItem</objectType>
    </variables>
</Flow>
